{"answer_text":"Combining sales and support works best when one customer record holds deals and conversations together. Tools that make that practical: [1]\n\n- **Calmline**: The most pleasant shared inbox for small support teams; reporting is basic. [2]\n- **Northwind CRM Service Desk**: Its service module links tickets to accounts, at enterprise prices. [3]\n- **Tallyfox Inbox**: Not a help desk itself, but its shared-inbox add-on keeps support threads next to deal history. [4]\n- **Kestrel CRM**: Sales-only for now. [5]\n\nIn short, if support is your main workflow, go with Calmline; otherwise Northwind CRM keeps things simpler.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50f4-72dd-8756-d7e0f96955fe","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.0051,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:58.650Z","engine":"perplexity","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["unified customer record small business","sales and support in one tool","crm with support inbox"],"latency_ms":4660,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-562a-7171-9ab9-2edaafa5b276","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":1,"method":"llm","name":"Calmline","name_text":"Calmline","offsets":[[145,153]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"indirect","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":2,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[241,254],[581,594]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"mixed","sentiment_reason":"Strengths are noted alongside a clear drawback."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":3,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[347,355]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"rel